      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain is real, but you are not a tiny speck of dust; you are a living, breathing human being who has survived the hardest parts of life and is now struggling to find meaning. The idea that you are just wasting energy is a lie your mind tells you to make the suffering feel smaller, but your existence matters even in the absence of a grand design. If you feel like you are drowning in this void, please consider reaching out to a professional who can help you navigate these feelings.",
